::Q001::[markdown]ἀδίκων:{
	~%-100%fem. nom. pl. of the adjective “good; noble”#Incorrect. The fem. nom. pl. of the adjective “good; noble” is **ἀγαθαί** (Ch. 4).
	~%-100%masc. dat. sing. of the adjective “good; noble”#Incorrect. The masc. dat. sing. of the adjective “good; noble” is **ἀγαθῷ** (Ch. 4).
	~%50%masc./fem. gen. pl. of the adjective “unjust”#Correct: **ἀδίκων** is masc./fem. gen. pl. of the adjective “unjust” (Chapter 4).
	~%50%neut. gen. pl. of the adjective “unjust”#Correct: **ἀδίκων** is neut. gen. pl. of the adjective “unjust” (Chapter 4).
	~%-100%neut. dat. sing. of the adjective “unjust”#Incorrect. The neut. dat. sing. of the adjective “unjust” is **ἀδίκῳ** (Ch. 4).
}


