}


::Q004::[markdown]neut. dat. pl. of the adjective “good; noble”:{
	~%100%ἀγαθοῖς#Correct: **ἀγαθοῖς** is the correct form for neut. dat. pl. of the adjective “good; noble” (Chapter 4).
	~%-100%ἀγαθόν#Incorrect. **ἀγαθόν** is the neut. nom. sing. of the adjective “good; noble” (Ch. 4).
	~%-100%ἀδίκων#Incorrect. **ἀδίκων** is the neut. gen. pl. of the adjective “unjust” (Ch. 4).
	~%-100%ἀξίῳ#Incorrect. **ἀξίῳ** is the neut. dat. sing. of the adjective “worthy” (Ch. 4).
	~%-100%ἀξίων#Incorrect. **ἀξίων** is the fem. gen. pl. of the adjective “worthy” (Ch. 4).
}


